  {app="regexp_33a", foo="l", foo_extracted="le"} "p|lit|b" @ 10s [metadata foo_extracted_extracted="me"] [parsed bar="b"]
# regexp: a label filter after the parser, for every final value of `foo_extracted` and `foo`. Key order a.
